<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106604" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλημα</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span>) mostly in pl., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>woody plants,</i> esp. of <i>shrubs, bushes</i>
			(including <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ φρυγανικὰ καὶ
			θαμνώδη</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.5.3
			</span></i> (cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλήματα</span>), cf.
				<i><span class="en">
				1.6.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.10.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.3.6
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δένδρα</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποώδη,</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				4.4.5
			</span></i>: sg., ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.16.4
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑληματικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i>belonging to the class of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλημα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.11.10
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
